    "message": "Merge pull request #1822 from ZalithLauncher/fix/floating_ball_offscreen_after_resolution_change\n\nfix: 悬浮球位置在窗口尺寸变化后超出屏幕不可见",
    "created_at": "2026-09-09T18:21:19Z",
